    "title": "pandas.tseries.offsets.QuarterBegin.is_year_start — pandas 3.0.5 documentation",
    "status": 200,
    "markdown": "# pandas.tseries.offsets.QuarterBegin.is_year_start#\n\n- \nQuarterBegin.is_year_start(*ts* )#\n- Return boolean whether a timestamp occurs on the year start. \n  - Parameters:\n    - **ts** Timestamp\n    - The timestamp to check.\n See also \n  - `is_year_end`\n  - Return boolean whether a timestamp occurs on the year end.\n Examples >>> ts = pd.Timestamp(2022, 1, 1) >>> freq = pd.offsets.Hour(5) >>> freq.is_year_start(ts) True",
